{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32641","headline":"龙门留别道友 · 刘沧","name":"龙门留别道友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一顾恩深荷道安，独垂双泪下层峦。\n飞鸣北鴈塞云暮，摇落西风关树寒。\n春谷终期吹羽翼，萍身不定逐波澜。\n裴徊偏起旧枝恋，半夜独吟孤烛残。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32641.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32641","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}